+		 * stock daemon's own order: the res-settings table (which
+		 * programmes the 24 MHz PLL block, timing, crop, ISP state:
+		 * everything), THEN the standby release, then ctrl/AEC
+		 * values, then stream-on.  A failure here leaves an
+		 * unknown sensor state -- refuse to stream.
+		 */
+		ret = cci_multi_reg_write(ov5693->regmap, ov5693_stock_m0_regs,
+					  ARRAY_SIZE(ov5693_stock_m0_regs),
